      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.calaverashistory.org/happy-valley",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Louis and Eugene Baudin built a stone winery in Happy Valley and grew vineyards and orchards on 40 acres by 1870.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
